  net against future invoices within
  the same MSA - automatically, with
  no action, forms, or bank details
  required from you:

    - Q1 invoices carry a "credit
      applied" line referencing
      CM-88417
    - Cash refunds of credits are
      available ONLY where the MSA
      is terminating, and then
      solely through a paper
      authorization on your
      letterhead, countersigned
      by your MSA signatory, sent
      to the address in the MSA
      notices clause - never
      through an emailed form

